# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1
# Imagen ÚNICA para Render (API + interfaz en un servicio, un solo dominio).
# En una VM con docker compose se usan las dos imágenes separadas (Dockerfile y api/Dockerfile).

FROM node:22-alpine AS api
WORKDIR /app
COPY api/package.json api/package-lock.json ./
RUN npm ci
COPY api/tsconfig.json api/tsconfig.build.json ./
COPY api/src ./src
RUN npm run build && npm prune --omit=dev

FROM node:22-alpine AS web
WORKDIR /app
RUN npm install -g bun@1
COPY package.json bun.lock bunfig.toml ./
RUN bun install --frozen-lockfile
COPY . .
ARG VITE_MOSTRAR_DEMO=true
ENV VITE_API_URL=/api/v1 VITE_MOSTRAR_DEMO=$VITE_MOSTRAR_DEMO
RUN NITRO_PRESET=node-server npx vite build

FROM node:22-alpine
ENV NODE_ENV=production STORAGE_DRIVER=db TRUST_PROXY=true
RUN addgroup -S nexus && adduser -S nexus -G nexus
WORKDIR /app
COPY --from=api /app/node_modules ./api/node_modules
COPY --from=api /app/dist ./api/dist
COPY api/package.json ./api/
COPY api/drizzle ./api/drizzle
COPY --from=web /app/.output ./web/.output
COPY deploy/render/iniciar.mjs ./iniciar.mjs
USER nexus
EXPOSE 10000
CMD ["node", "/app/iniciar.mjs"]
